    "created_at": "2023-10-19T04:15:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-10-19T04:15:56Z",
    "body": "Instead of\n\n~~~~ html\n    <subcaption>Status 1</subcaption>\n    <tbody>\n        <td>Data 1</td>\n~~~~\n\nall of the following, nesting within `tbody`, would make more structural sense to me:\n\n~~~~ html\n    <tbody>\n        <subcaption>Status 1</subcaption>\n        <td>Data 1</td>\n~~~~\n\n~~~~ html\n    <tbody>\n        <caption>Status 1</caption>\n        <td>Data 1</td>\n~~~~\n\n~~~~ html\n    <tbody>\n        <h2>Status 1</h2>\n        <td>Data 1</td>\n~~~~\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
